      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──让现在的葛城王牌对上千明代表，\n究竟能够较劲到什么程度呢？\n说实话，还存在着很多未知数……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e11bad0b460ba0cae95e04a2c0ba8051e9a183fe433f0c5435b7fcb69677ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
